# Keeps the build context for packaging/docker/Dockerfile.build-jammy to the
# sources a compile actually reads. Without this the context is the whole tree,
# including bin/ and node_modules, and every build ships it to the daemon.
#
# Nothing here is generated at build time: the go:embed inputs
# (cmd/juggler/webui/wails_runtime.js and the app icon) are tracked files, and
# the Makefile targets that refresh them are idempotent syncs run before docker.

.git
bin
tooling/node_modules
node_modules
.juggler
tests/benchmarks/results
*.log
.DS_Store
